From: Jan Vermaete <jan.vermaete@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] CMakeLists.txt: Drop obsolete Boost.System component

Boost.System is header-only in current Boost releases and no longer provides
a separate CMake package configuration. Do not request it as a component.

Upstream-Status: Pending

---
 CMakeLists.txt | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 5db0f14..f2b40e8 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.0.2)
 project(cpp_common)
 
-find_package(Boost REQUIRED COMPONENTS system thread)
+find_package(Boost REQUIRED COMPONENTS thread)
 find_package(console_bridge REQUIRED)
 find_package(catkin REQUIRED)
 catkin_package(
